{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 16. Ticket updated — member
  File       : ticket-updated-user.liquid
  Class      : Support (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Support added a reply to the member’s ticket
  Tone       : verify
  Replaces   : ticket-updated-user.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Update on your ticket {{ reply.ticketNo }}

  PREHEADER
    A new message has been added to your support ticket.

  PRIMARY CTA
    none — this template asks for nothing

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/ticket-updated-user.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/16-ticket-updated-user.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
